{ "Render", "Threading", "General", "bMainThreadQueue", RowType::kBool, "1", 0.0f, 1.0f, 0.1f, "", "Game work on the main thread", "Our game / menu / scene changes run on the game's main thread between frames (where console commands run). 0 = F4SE's task queue (any thread) and polls at Present, as before 20 Nov.", "@reload", true },
