{ "FRIK", "Body", "FRIK", "bBodyGraphSpeedContour", RowType::kBool, "1", 0.0f, 1.0f, 0.1f, "", "Body graph: own walk speed", "The body animation gets its own speed and the game's walk / run pacing (speed contour), as in third person. Off: it reuses the first-person value (walk cycle can play too slowly). Live.", "frik reread", true },
{ "FRIK", "Body", "FRIK", "bPovSwitchSync", RowType::kBool, "1", 0.0f, 1.0f, 0.1f, "", "Keep view switches in step with the body", "VATS playback / third person switches run completely with the FRIK body shown (animated VATS body, VATS shots from the real muzzle, no stuck crouch height after VATS). Live.", "frik reread", true },
